(
    title: "Pete Rose Baseball",
    developer: Some("Alex DeMeo"),
    description: Some("Absolute Entertainment\'s baseball simulation, designed by Alex DeMeo and carrying Cincinnati Reds star Pete Rose\'s endorsement. The view shifts as play unfolds — a \"behind the pitcher\" angle for pitching and batting, and bird\'s-eye views of the field that follow where the ball is hit — across a one- or two-player game. When the Pete Rose licence lapsed the game was reissued simply as \"Baseball\", the form in which Skyworks re-released it on cartridge in 2002 and the Activision Anthology bundled it."),
